# Elven Raft-Steerer, a 3/2: "Landfall - Whenever a land you control enters, choose one - Tap target creature an opponent controls;
# or untap target creature you control." On turn 3 Bot1 plays an Island and chooses the first mode: Bot2's Grizzly Bears is tapped, its
# Ornithopter is not (the choice among two), and Bot1's own Raft-Steerer is refused. On turn 5 it attacks, and after combat a second Island untaps it
# with the second mode (Bot2's Bears refused), while its Ornithopter, also a legal target, stays as it was.

